Z||000001||lou_dias||03-13-2001||09:09 AM||||You are trying to access an object's property or method even though you haven't create the object yet...<P>Like:<P>dim MyRecordset as recordset<P>MyRecordset.Source = "select * from mytable"<P>you need to either:<BR>dim MyRecordset as NEW recordset<P>or:<BR>dim Myrecordset as recordset<P>set Myrecordset = new RECORDSET<BR>Myrecordset.OPEN "select * from table", myConnection, adOpenstatic, adLockReadOnle<P>don't forget that myConnection is an object also...<P>dim MyConnection as NEW CONNECTION<BR>MyCONNECTION.ConnectionString = "Provider...etc..."<BR>MyConnection.Open<P><BR>hope that helps...||||reg||1
